    "attributes an agreement share and rejects duplicate NULL-activity document rows permitted by native composite keys",
    "bounds a worker and honors already-aborted or in-flight cancellation without a main-loop SQLite call",
    "feeds normal authenticated missing-allocation HTTP payments into the existing financial lifecycle without weakening strict transport or inventing finality",
